  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Pistols, SMGs, Shotguns, and Assault Rifles capable of Autofire, or which already expend more than 1 round of ammunition when fired in Single Shot</p>\n<p>In Single Shot you may fire 2 extra rounds of the same ammo as Burst Fire, and all of them count as Armor-Piercing. If there aren't enough rounds, it empties the magazine as a normal Single Shot. Works with shotgun shells. On weapons that already fire several rounds per Single Shot, Burst Fire adds 2 to that count. Corgo's optional nerf: Burst Fire uses the weapon's Autofire DV table. Bimodal: Single Shot and Burst Fire only; no Autofire or Suppressive Fire.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
